  "description": "The Bliksem is our ideal Fast Gravel bike, designed for high-paced training and racing, while keeping the adventure fun on smooth or brutal terrain. Supporting up to a 50mm tyre clearance, these frames lean toward a more aggressive geometry, while staying sensible.\nFully hand-mitered and fillet brazed with a mix of Columbus Zona and Life tubing, featuring a T47 bottom bracket, and stainless steel brake mounts to avoid unnecessary wear and tear on your adventure. Each bike is hand-finished and painted to your customized specification.\n\"BLIKSEM!\" is what you'll hear as you pass your mates on that climb, or what you'll mutter through your breath when the hill just doesn't end. It's the Afrikaans word for \"lightning\" and, like all the best Afrikaans words, is multifaceted.",
